# Synthesizability gate for the complete TACCEL core — no target wrapper.
#
# The Verilator Makefile converts the sources from
# rtl/common/filelists/core.f with sv2v -DSFU_SYNTH_NO_DPI, then supplies the
# generated Verilog to Yosys before running this script.
#
# Definition of green: the full taccel_top hierarchy resolves, contains no
# reachable DPI/real dependency in the synthesis configuration, passes the
# structural check, and reports statistics. This is an elaboration/
# synthesizability gate, not technology mapping or timing analysis.

# Resolve the module hierarchy from the real top; loud early error on any
# missing/unresolved module.
hierarchy -check -top taccel_top

# Whole-design gate. It intentionally skips proc/flatten —
# sv2v emits ~17k auto-generated cast helper functions (one per
# `integer'(...)` widening in the 1024-element loops) that make proc
# multi-minute. Technology-mapped synthesis and timing live under rtl/asic/.

# Structural check.
check

# Elaboration-level statistics; not a physical area estimate.
stat
